    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1199">

                <pb facs="1402" n="1204" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg1204"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Truman Papers</note>
                <head>No. 1199<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">President Truman to Prime Minister
                        Churchill</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Babelsberg</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-23">23 July 1945</date>.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1199-f1"
                        /></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum for the Prime
                        Minister</hi></p>
                <p>In 1942 when the munitions resources of the United States and the United Kingdom
                    were insufficient to meet the requirements of the United Nations forces you and
                    President Roosevelt agreed to pool our munitions resources and to create
                    Munitions Assignments Boards in London and Washington to assign finished war
                    material to the several United Nations in accordance with strategic need.</p>
                <p>Since the munitions resources of the United States and the United Kingdom are now
                    generally more than sufficient to insure the success of combined strategy, I
                    consider that the Munitions Assignments Board, Washington, no longer serves a
                    useful purpose. I therefore propose to abolish this Board and would appreciate
                    your concurrence in this action.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Harry</hi> S. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Truman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
